gy transfer and conduction entirely. This matches the Beginning description of an explanation built on a misconception.","suggestedLevel":"beginning","excerpts":[{"artifact":"work","quote":"the ice likes it better and metal is too slippery so the ice slides around and melts"}],"uncertainty":"medium"}]}
